205
00:15:36,661 --> 00:15:40,047
in business, in finance, in religion, in politics.

206
00:15:40,516 --> 00:15:46,624
This is the method of leadership in Islam, which we have unfortunately diverted from.

207
00:15:48,086 --> 00:15:54,591
Number three, the Islamic State will be established on justice, and equality.

208
00:15:55,976 --> 00:16:01,487
ألضعيف يكفيكم قويٌ عِندِيْ حتى أرجع عليه حقَّه إن شاء الله

