214
00:16:24,093 --> 00:16:27,211
there's not going to be any preference of one over another.

215
00:16:27,654 --> 00:16:32,578
If there's anybody weak, I'm gonna give them what is due to them.

216
00:16:33,066 --> 00:16:36,855
And if there's anybody strong and thinks that they can take advantage of the strength

217
00:16:37,387 --> 00:16:41,157
I'm going to take away from them, what is due to others.

