00:18:35,767 --> 00:18:37,801
because the Ajr(أجْر) is going to come on the day of judgment.

244
00:18:39,213 --> 00:18:45,730
And the next year he raised up the salary or the stipend whatever you would call it to 20 from 10 to 20.

