427
00:32:27,682 --> 00:32:31,076
you have duties, you have some duties towards the Ummah(امة) that you have to fulfill

428
00:32:31,363 --> 00:32:33,278
and you're buying and selling garments.

429
00:32:34,406 --> 00:32:36,686
Abu Bakr As-Siddique(أبوبكرالصديق) said: I have to feed my kids

