What are you doing?

504
00:37:09,582 --> 00:37:14,447
He said: The salary that you gave me is not enough and I need to feed my kids.

505
00:37:15,227 --> 00:37:17,569
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) said: Fine, we'll give you a pay raise.

506
00:37:18,026 --> 00:37:20,011
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) is the one making the decisions.

507
00:37:20,296 --> 00:37:21,984
He said: We'll give you a pay raise.

508
00:37:22,849 --> 00:37:25,212
So he takes Abu Bakr As-Siddique(أبوبكرالصديق) with him,

509
00:37:25,611 --> 00:37:27,181
and he says: We'll give you a pay raise.

510
00:37:27,419 --> 00:37:28,917
Abu Bakr As-Siddique رضي الله عنه said;

511
00:37:28,941 --> 00:37:34,126
You pay me 300 Dinar(دينار), a year, and you'll gives me the whole sheep, per day.

512
00:37:34,849 --> 00:37:36,955
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) said: No! We're not gonna give you that.

