517
00:37:44,125 --> 00:37:46,099
He said: Yes! I think so. Give it to him.

518
00:37:46,429 --> 00:37:49,449
He said: Alright we agree, we'll give you the whole sheep and 300 Dinar(دينار).

519
00:37:49,711 --> 00:37:52,995
Umar Ibn Al-Khattab(عمرابن الخطاب) is still arguing, he is trying to bargain a better deal.

520
00:37:54,885 --> 00:37:57,162
But Ali Ibn Abi Talib(علي ابن ابي طالب) said: No! Just give it to the Khalifah(خليفه).

521
00:37:58,898 --> 00:38:01,564
Then Abu Bakr As-Siddique(أبوبكرالصديق), he goes and he stands on the Mimber(ممبر)

