You have paid me 250 Dinar(دينار) a year and half a sheep per day

524
00:38:10,034 --> 00:38:11,602
and that wasn't enough for me.

525
00:38:12,005 --> 00:38:18,020
So, Umar(عُمَر) and Ali Ibn Abi Talib(علي ابن ابي طالب) gave me a pay raise 300 Dinar(دينار) per year,

526
00:38:18,224 --> 00:38:21,494
and the entire sheep per day.

527
00:38:21,706 --> 00:38:22,680
Do you agree?

528
00:38:23,161 --> 00:38:24,762
They said: Yes, we agree.

529
00:38:26,065 --> 00:38:27,172
Allah Ho Akbar(الله أكبر)

530
00:38:27,786 --> 00:38:29,541
He has to get the consent of his people.

531
00:38:31,861 --> 00:38:36,849
It's like you're talking about the dream world, something that is fantasy رضي الله عنه.

532
00:38:37,826 --> 00:38:42,481
A few things, I wanted to note here, number one, some people might be wondering

533
00:38:42,782 --> 00:38:44,956
how come one sheep a day that seems a lot,

534
00:38:45,654 --> 00:38:48,304
one sheep a day, it's a lot of meat.

535
00:38:50,733 --> 00:38:56,207
First of all, I used to think before that it may be because of the size of the family of Abu Bakr(ابوبكر)

536
00:38:56,680 --> 00:38:58,913
but then when you look at it at that particular time.

537
00:38:59,355 --> 00:39:03,180
He has already divorced one of his wives and one of his wives has died.

538
00:39:04,114 --> 00:39:08,018
So he had two wives, and most of his kids were adults

539
00:39:08,042 --> 00:39:10,801
he had two boys and two girls.

540
00:39:11,229 --> 00:39:16,101
Abdur Rahman(عبدالرحمن) was an adult and Abdullah(عبدالله) might have passed away then

541
00:39:16,181 --> 00:39:18,283
 because he passed away during the Khilafah(خِلَافَه) of his father.

542
00:39:19,090 --> 00:39:22,493
Ayesha(عائشه) was Umm Al-Mo'mineen(أم المؤمنين), so she was taken care of

543
00:39:22,517 --> 00:39:25,216
being the wife of Rasool Allah ﷺ from the fae(فيئ).

